    "detailed_description": "Vertex Rush - A Fast-Paced Climbing Adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready for an adrenaline-pumping climbing adventure with Vertex Rush! In this addictive game, you'll need to guide your character up a tower while collecting diamonds along the way. But be warned - the blocks below disappear quickly, and one wrong move could send you plummeting to your doom!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo play, simply use the left and right arrow keys to climb up the tower. The faster you climb, the more points you'll earn - but be careful not to move too quickly and miss the diamonds. Each diamond you collect adds to your score<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith its simple yet challenging gameplay, Vertex Rush is the perfect game for anyone who loves a good challenge. So what are you waiting for? Download Vertex Rush now and start your climb to the top!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFast-paced climbing gameplay<br />\r\nCollect diamonds for extra points<br />\r\nAvoid disappearing blocks to stay alive<br />\r\nSimple controls make it easy to play, but difficult to master",
